.TH MOCHI-SESSIOND 1 "2026-09-28" "Mochi @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mochi-sessiond \- maintain per-user Mochi conversation connections
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mochi-sessiond
.SH DESCRIPTION
Owns conversation bindings, delivery state and heartbeat independently of
the renderer. Installed sessions normally use systemd user socket activation.
The service does not run a model or persist reply tokens or message bodies.
.SH FILES
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/mochi
contains private session sockets.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
Use the Manager Connections page or
.B journalctl --user -u mochi-sessiond.service
for service diagnostics.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mochi-manager (1),
.BR systemctl (1),
.BR journalctl (1)
